(9320, 0, 0, 402731, 27856, 'Timerunner: Warrior', '$N,$B$BI have watched a great many timelines, and in every one of them you reached the height of your power sooner or later. In this one it was sooner! Take this Felscorned War Wyrm; it was always going to be yours.$B$BChromie', 0),
