(9330, 0, 0, 400826, 14508, 'Honor Level 15', '$N,$B$BThe Gurubashi bookmakers have been keeping count of your victories, and so have I. A fighter with your record deserves to arrive in style: this Prestigious Bronze Courser is yours.$B$BShort John Mithril', 0),
(9331, 0, 0, 400833, 14508, 'Honor Level 40', '$N,$B$BThe Gurubashi bookmakers have been keeping count of your victories, and so have I. A fighter with your record deserves to arrive in style: this Prestigious Ivory Courser is yours.$B$BShort John Mithril', 0),
