(9335, 0, 0, 400836, 14508, 'Honor Level 250', '$N,$B$BThe Gurubashi bookmakers have been keeping count of your victories, and so have I. A fighter with your record deserves to arrive in style: this Prestigious Midnight Courser is yours.$B$BShort John Mithril', 0),
