(9340, 0, 0, 401030, 14508, 'Gladiator: Battle for Azeroth Season 1', '$N,$B$BThat makes another season of battlegrounds won. The crowds talk of little else, and a champion needs a mount to match. Take the Dread Gladiator\'s Proto-Drake, and keep winning.$B$BShort John Mithril', 0),
