(9360, 0, 0, 400554, 29611, 'Grievous Combatant', '$N,$B$BYour victories on the battlefield have not gone unnoticed in Stormwind. Ride this Vicious Kaldorei Warsaber with pride, and show the Horde what the Alliance is made of.$B$BKing Varian Wrynn', 0),
(9361, 0, 0, 400555, 4949, 'Grievous Combatant', '$N,$B$BWord of your victories has reached Orgrimmar. The Horde honours those who bleed for it. Take this Vicious Skeletal Warhorse and ride at the front of our warbands.$B$BThrall, Warchief of the Horde', 0),
