(9379, 0, 0, 401045, 4949, 'Fierce Combatant', '$N,$B$BWord of your victories has reached Orgrimmar. The Horde honours those who bleed for it. Take this Vicious War Clefthoof and ride at the front of our warbands.$B$BThrall, Warchief of the Horde', 0),
(9380, 0, 0, 401194, 29611, 'Dominant Combatant', '$N,$B$BYour victories on the battlefield have not gone unnoticed in Stormwind. Ride this Vicious White Warsaber with pride, and show the Horde what the Alliance is made of.$B$BKing Varian Wrynn', 0),
(9381, 0, 0, 401197, 4949, 'Dominant Combatant', '$N,$B$BWord of your victories has reached Orgrimmar. The Horde honours those who bleed for it. Take this Vicious White Bonesteed and ride at the front of our warbands.$B$BThrall, Warchief of the Horde', 0),
(9382, 0, 0, 401195, 29611, 'Demonic Combatant', '$N,$B$BYour victories on the battlefield have not gone unnoticed in Stormwind. Ride this Vicious Black Warsaber with pride, and show the Horde what the Alliance is made of.$B$BKing Varian Wrynn', 0),
(9383, 0, 0, 401196, 4949, 'Demonic Combatant', '$N,$B$BWord of your victories has reached Orgrimmar. The Horde honours those who bleed for it. Take this Vicious Black Bonesteed and ride at the front of our warbands.$B$BThrall, Warchief of the Horde', 0),
(9390, 0, 0, 400606, 13278, 'Boldly, You Sought the Power of Ragnaros', '$N,$B$BThe Firelord has fallen, and the waters of Azeroth are calmer for it. The Core Hounds that served him will serve you now; this one has been tamed. Take good care of it, and keep it away from water.$B$BDuke Hydraxis', 0),
(9391, 0, 0, 401240, 27856, 'Memories of Fel, Frost and Fire', '$N,$B$BAzuregos, Kazzak, Doomwalker... I have seen those battles end badly in more timelines than I care to count. Not this time. The Obsidian Worldbreaker is a small thank-you from the bronze dragonflight.$B$BChromie', 0),
(9392, 0, 0, 402604, 28070, 'Titan Console Overcharged', '$N,$B$BYou faced the Observer and Azeroth is still here! I found this OC91 Chariot in one of the halls of Ulduar, and the titans\' machines took to you better than they ever did to me. It\'s yours.$B$BBrann Bronzebeard', 0),
(9400, 0, 0, 401669, 28027, 'Wake Me Up', '$N,$B$BThe Oracles have seen your deeds in the waters of the basin, and the Great Ones smile. Please take this Bestowed Ohuna Spotter as our thanks.$B$BHigh-Oracle Soo-say', 0),
(9401, 0, 0, 401633, 26194, 'Army of the Fed', '$N,$B$BThe Kalu\'ak do not forget a friend. You have stood with our people from the Borean Tundra to the Howling Fjord. This Bestowed Trawling Mammoth carried our hunters across the ice; now it will carry you.$B$BElder Ko\'nani', 0),
(9402, 0, 0, 401651, 22113, 'Flight Club', '$N,$B$BThe Netherwing are free because of you, and Neltharaku asked that you be thanked properly. This Bestowed Ottuk Vanguard chose you as its rider.$B$BMordenai', 0),
(9403, 0, 0, 403062, 25140, 'Assault the Vault', '$N,$B$BThe Sunwell is restored and the Isle is ours again. The Shattered Sun Offensive owes you a debt. Please accept this Venomous Coiler.$B$BLord Torvos', 0),
(9404, 0, 0, 402655, 23233, 'Phase-Lost-and-Found', '$N,$B$BOgri\'la is safe and the crystals sing your name. The ogres of the Blade\'s Edge are not given to gifts, but this Phase-Lost Slateback is one.$B$BChu\'a\'lor', 0),
(9405, 0, 0, 402829, 19674, 'Staring Into The Void', '$N,$B$BThe Consortium values its most profitable friends. Consider this Lab-Grown Stormray a dividend on our partnership.$B$BNexus-Prince Haramad', 0),
(9406, 0, 0, 400413, 12944, 'The Molten Front Offensive', '$N,$B$BThe Thorium Brotherhood and the Hydraxian Waterlords agree on very little, but they agree on you. This Flameward Hippogryph was forged for a friend of both.$B$BLokhtos Darkbargainer', 0),
(9407, 0, 0, 400450, 26194, 'Pandaren Ambassador', '$N,$B$BThe Kalu\'ak, the Oracles and even the Frenzyheart speak your name with respect. Few walk between so many peoples. This Pandaren Kite is a gift from all of us.$B$BElder Ko\'nani', 0),
(9408, 0, 0, 400450, 26194, 'Pandaren Ambassador', '$N,$B$BThe Kalu\'ak, the Oracles and even the Frenzyheart speak your name with respect. Few walk between so many peoples. This Pandaren Kite is a gift from all of us.$B$BElder Ko\'nani', 0),
(9409, 0, 0, 401238, 17841, 'Undersea Usurper', '$N,$B$BThe waters of Zangarmarsh are flowing freely again, and the Cenarion Expedition thanks you. This Snapback Scuttler was found in the depths of Coilfang; it seems to like you.$B$BYsiel Windsinger', 0),
(9410, 0, 0, 401277, 2496, 'I\'m On Island Time', '$N,$B$BBooty Bay, Gadgetzan, Ratchet and Everlook all count you as a friend, which makes you very good for business. Here\'s a Honeyback Hivemother to get you between them faster.$B$BBaron Revilgaz', 0),
(9411, 0, 0, 402190, 21700, 'You Xal Not Pass', '$N,$B$BThe Ashtongue Deathsworn will not forget what you have done in Shadowmoon Valley. Take this Shadow of Doubt, friend of the Broken.$B$BAkama', 0),
(9412, 0, 0, 401621, 30105, 'Into the Storm', '$N,$B$BThe Sons of Hodir sing of your deeds in the Storm Peaks. Hodir himself wished you to have this Coralscale Salamanther.$B$BKing Jokkum', 0),
(9413, 0, 0, 401618, 20142, 'Closing Time', '$N,$B$BYour work in Tanaris and Silithus has kept the timeways steady. The Keepers of Time wish you to have this Bestowed Sandskimmer.$B$BSteward of Time', 0),
(9414, 0, 0, 401614, 27990, 'Across the Isles', '$N,$B$BFew have seen as much of Northrend as you have. Dalaran\'s scholars could fill a library with your travels. This Stormtouched Bruffalon will carry you to the next one.$B$BKrasus', 0),
(9415, 0, 0, 400986, 19674, '...And Chew Mana Buns', '$N,$B$BYou have walked every road of Netherstorm and finished every job we had there. The Consortium does not usually give anything away for free, but this Bleakhoof Ruinstrider is yours.$B$BNexus-Prince Haramad', 0),
(9416, 0, 0, 403053, 6546, 'Pro Poison Patroller', '$N,$B$BThe marshes have quieted since you came through. Even the Theramore guards nod at me now, which is your doing. Take this Emerald Skyfang; it doesn\'t mind the mud.$B$BTabetha', 0),
(9417, 0, 0, 402332, 25246, 'Isle Remember You', '$N,$B$BThe Isle of Quel\'Danas will remember you. This The Breaker\'s Song is a gift from those who fought beside you there.$B$BLady Liadrin', 0),
(9418, 0, 0, 401474, 5397, 'Centaur of Attention', '$N,$B$BThe centaur of Desolace fear you and the earth remembers your footsteps. Uthek has seen it in the stones. Take this Bestowed Thunderspine Packleader.$B$BUthek the Wise', 0),
(9419, 0, 0, 401733, 9021, 'Que Zara(lek), Zara(lek)', '$N,$B$BYou\'ve done more for the prisoners of Blackrock Depths than any king I\'ve known. Take this Calescent Shalewing as thanks from the Mighthammer clan.$B$BKharan Mighthammer', 0),
(9420, 0, 0, 401247, 7944, 'Mecha-Done', '$N,$B$BThermaplugg is beaten and Gnomeregan has a future again! I\'ve been tinkering with this Mechacycle Model W for weeks, and I can\'t think of a better test pilot.$B$BTinkmaster Overspark', 0),
(9421, 0, 0, 402511, 264, 'Vigilante', '$N,$B$BThe Night Watch is short on hands, and whatever banner you fly, you did the work of a dozen. Duskwood is safer for it. Take this Terror of the Night; it doesn\'t scare easily.$B$BCommander Althea Ebonlocke', 0),
(9422, 0, 0, 401551, 27785, 'From A to Zereth', '$N,$B$BThe titans\' works in Sholazar Basin and the Storm Peaks hold few secrets from you now. The green dragonflight sends you this Cryptic Aurelid with its thanks.$B$BLord Itharius', 0),
(9423, 0, 0, 401446, 20142, 'Fake It \'Til You Make It', '$N,$B$BThe infinite dragonflight tried to undo Thrall\'s escape, and you would not let them, even on the hardest road. Accept this Tazavesh Gearglider from the Keepers of Time.$B$BSteward of Time', 0),
(9424, 0, 0, 402188, 15077, 'The Derby Dash', '$N,$B$BBest catch I\'ve seen in years! Every winner of the Extravaganza gets a prize, and you get a special one: this Kah, Legend of the Deep. Don\'t get it wet.$B$BRiggle Bassbait', 0),
(9425, 0, 0, 401190, 18166, '40 Exalted Reputations', '$N,$B$BI have spent my life between peoples who would rather not speak to each other. You have earned the trust of more of them than I ever did. Take this Pureheart Courser.$B$BKhadgar', 0),
(9426, 0, 0, 402755, 26917, 'Life of the Party', '$N,$B$BBrewfest, Midsummer and Hallow\'s End: you have danced, drunk and lit the fires with the best of them. This Umbral Dragonhawk is for the life of every party.$B$BAlexstrasza the Life-Binder', 0),
(9427, 0, 0, 402755, 26917, 'Life of the Party', '$N,$B$BBrewfest, Midsummer and Hallow\'s End: you have danced, drunk and lit the fires with the best of them. This Umbral Dragonhawk is for the life of every party.$B$BAlexstrasza the Life-Binder', 0),
(9428, 0, 0, 401825, 26917, 'A World Awoken', '$N,$B$BNorthrend has awoken, and you were there for all of it. The Aspects ask you to accept this Taivan.$B$BAlexstrasza the Life-Binder', 0),
(9429, 0, 0, 402802, 18166, 'Worldsoul-Searching', '$N,$B$BYou have seen all of Outland, done its work and won the trust of its peoples. I could not have asked for more. This Geargrinder Mk. 11 is my thanks.$B$BKhadgar', 0),
(9430, 0, 0, 402802, 18166, 'Worldsoul-Searching', '$N,$B$BYou have seen all of Outland, done its work and won the trust of its peoples. I could not have asked for more. This Geargrinder Mk. 11 is my thanks.$B$BKhadgar', 0),
(9431, 0, 0, 402114, 28444, 'Back from the Beyond', '$N,$B$BThe Lich King is dead and the Scourge is broken. The Knights of the Ebon Blade will remember who stood at the Frozen Throne. Take this Zovaal\'s Soul Eater.$B$BHighlord Darion Mograine', 0),
(9432, 0, 0, 401224, 27990, 'Northrend Pathfinder', '$N,$B$BYou have mapped Northrend from end to end and held Wintergrasp. Dalaran is grateful; take this Wonderwing 2.0 for the roads ahead.$B$BKrasus', 0);
